  "post_content": "<p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">M&aacute;s de 250 afiliados y simpatizantes del Partido Popular de la provincia de Castell&oacute;n, seg&uacute;n destaca una nota del Gabinete de Comunicaci&oacute;n del PP provincial, han participado antes de comer en los Salones Princesa en el mitin que se ha celebrado en Onda y que ha contado con las intervenciones del presidente provincial, Javier Moliner Gargallo, el conseller de Sanitat, Manuel Llombart, y el alcalde, Salvador Aguilella Ramos.</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acte-pp-onda/img_0980.jpg\" alt=\"img_0980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acte-pp-onda/img_0981.jpg\" alt=\"img_0981\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acte-pp-onda/img_0983.jpg\" alt=\"img_0983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acte-pp-onda/img_0984.jpg\" alt=\"img_0984\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acte-pp-onda/img_0985.jpg\" alt=\"img_0985\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acte-pp-onda/img_0986.jpg\" alt=\"img_0986\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acte-pp-onda/img_0987.jpg\" alt=\"img_0987\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acte-pp-onda/img_0988.jpg\" alt=\"img_0988\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/